(* Simple Harmonic Motion \(SHM\): Restoring force is directly proportional to) Tj
T*
(displacement from equilibrium: F = - k * x => d^2x/dt^2 + omega_0^2 * x = 0, where) Tj
T*
(natural angular frequency omega_0 = sqrt\(k / m\).) Tj
T*
(* One-Dimensional Wave Equation: A spatial disturbance y\(x,t\) propagating with wave) Tj
T*
(velocity v satisfies: d^2y/dx^2 = \(1 / v^2\) * \(d^2y/dt^2\).) Tj
