T*
(across crystal faces when ultrasonic waves strike them.) Tj
T*
(* 2. Acoustic Diffraction Grating Method: Ultrasonic longitudinal waves set up) Tj
T*
(periodic spatial compressions and rarefactions in a transparent liquid, modulating) Tj
T*
(its local refractive index to act as an optical diffraction grating for monochromatic) Tj
T*
(light.) Tj
T*
(* 3. Kundt's Tube with Lycopodium Powder: Nodal and antinodal stationary wave) Tj
